                    Note that in 32bit mode, there is one exception thrown
                    'Arithmetic underflow on line number 520' just once
                    before the first line of data.  This is an unfortunate
                    result of float<->double conversion issues because EXP() 
                    uses 64bit double but add, subtract, divide and multiply 
                    are 32bit, and also the constants in the program are all
                    32bit.
